{
 "_doc": "Companies that do NOT file consolidated results. Their consolidated cells are NOT data gaps -- there is nothing to fill -- so coverage audits must exclude them from gap counts. Two classes: never_filed_con (no consolidated filing at any point) and stopped_filing_con (filed consolidated, then stopped -- excluded from that quarter onward). Evidence for never_filed_con: scripts/xbrl_nature.json shows >=4 cached filings and ZERO NatureOfReportStandaloneConsolidated=Consolidated declarations, AND our stored con never diverges from std. CUB and ENRIN added on the user's primary-source check (screener.in, 2026-08-06): CUB carries a single 2022-03 divergence and ENRIN too few cached filings, so the automated test could not clear them. Built 2026-08-06 after the is_con_basis fix.",
 "_evidence_notes": {
  "ALIVUS": "user check on screener.in 2026-08-06: never filed consolidated. Missed by the first automated pass because it requires >=4 cached XBRL filings and ALIVUS has 1; its own stored data (25 quarters holding both bases, ZERO divergent) was always sufficient evidence.",
  "ALKYLAMINE": "user check 2026-08-06: last consolidated filing Mar-2020, none since.",
  "CERA": "user check on screener.in 2026-08-06: last consolidated filing Jun-2025, none since.",
  "CUB": "user primary-source check on screener.in, 2026-08-06: never filed consolidated",
  "ENRIN": "user primary-source check on screener.in, 2026-08-06: never filed consolidated",
  "FACT": "user check on screener.in 2026-08-06: last consolidated filing Dec-2025.",
  "JUSTDIAL": "Q1FY26 filing note 6: \"The Company does not have any subsidiary or associate company and consequently, the Company is not required to prepare consolidated financial results as per applicable laws and regulations.\" Primary evidence, 2026-08-06.",
  "JYOTHYLAB": "user check on screener.in 2026-08-06: last consolidated filing Mar-2025. Its own Q1FY26 filing note says the company \"had then published consolidated segment results\" -- past tense.",
  "SBFC": "user primary-source check 2026-08-06: last consolidated filing Mar-2025, none for the four quarters since. Matches stored data exactly -- patC diverges through 20250331 (93.94 vs std 94.39) then is identical from 20250630.",
  "UCOBANK": "user primary-source check 2026-08-06: last consolidated filing Mar-2025, none since. Stored data agrees -- patC diverges through 20250331 then goes identical.",
  "_ceased": "Entities that ceased filing ANY results. Verified across BSE announcements, BSE detailed-results and the NSE archive (see runbook \u00a751c/\u00a752c). Their cells are not gaps in ANY metric -- there is no company left to report.",
  "_rule_4q": "USER RULE 2026-08-06: exclude any company with no real consolidated filing for the last 4+ quarters. Detected as: >=2 quarters where stored con genuinely diverges from std (proof it once consolidated), then >=4 later quarters with no divergence. Excluded from the quarter AFTER its last real consolidated filing."
 },
